UnitMigration::ClaimFees
├── when the caller is not the owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
└── when the caller is the owner
    ├── given the recipient is the zero address
    │   └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
    └── given the recipient is not the zero address
        ├── when fee contracts and token arrays are provided
        │   ├── it should forward the arrays and migration token id
        │   └── it should transfer the requested token balances to the recipient
        ├── when the outer arrays are empty
        │   └── it should forward the empty arrays
        ├── when the outer array lengths differ
        │   └── it should forward the arrays without local validation
        └── given the contract is paused
            └── it should forward the arrays and migration token id
